WEBVTT

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.480
Sorry, though. My lunch is nearly over.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.240
Okay, I'll do it as soon as possible.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:21.950
Is this the place?

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:25.250
Yes. I'm sure I feel the presence of the Tera I sensed the other day.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.580
We need to investigate it.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.420
Thank you for using our services.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.760
"Pursuer"

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:38.390
What happened to Keita-kun?

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:40.310
He seemed to be in a hurry.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:46.690
Erm, sir...

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:51.440
Counter 3 over there is the one serving number 321.

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:56.610
Uh... Sir?

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.700
This Tera is...

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:05.580
Yes, it's more than expected.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:07.830
Hello?

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.880
Bonjour?

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.050
Buenas tardes?

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:16.380
Daddy! What are you doing?

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:18.390
Japanese?

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:22.390
Didn't you promise to buy me that limited edition Dolfar figure at Akiba?

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:25.770
It'll be sold out if we don't hurry there!

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.100
I know. Just calm down.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.650
I'm sorry.

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:32.150
Counter 3, right?

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:33.440
Yes.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:37.150
Japanese woman are prettier than they say.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.780
I hope you have a nice day.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.200
Gosh, Daddy!

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.790
Keep it a secret from Mommy.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:50.630
Thank you for using our services.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.800
An unusual amount of Tera is flowing within her.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:59.720
However, the Tera of the Mototsumitama I sensed the other day is getting weaker.

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.430
They didn't form a contract?

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:03.430
So it seems.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:04.770
Then, why?

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.180
Thank you for using our services.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.440
Um, excuse me...

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:20.820
Even though she didn't form a contract, I sense the presence of a Mototsumitama in her Tera.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.280
We need to investigate her.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:26.950
She left.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.340
Follow her.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:38.220
Roger.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.730
I didn't expect that even Sensei was...

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.150
What should I do from now on?

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.490
Keita-san, this is bad!

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:02.740
What's wrong?

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:07.740
There are too many delicious things! I can't decide!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.500
He came out.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.210
Punipuni.

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:21.010
You can eat whatever you want.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.640
Really?

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.720
Thanks!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:30.140
Ah, Akane-san!

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:12.770
Thanks for the food!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.770
Punipuni!

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:20.570
Could you please keep it down?

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.030
Sorry.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.070
And then?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.740
Kuro defeated the teacher who attacked us.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:31.830
Should I say that I escaped from school, or that I can no longer stay there...?

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.790
It'd be better for you to make a report, then.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:36.460
To whom?

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.630
The police, obviously.

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:41.210
Since you were attacked by bad guys and all.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:42.710
However...

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.800
We can't go to the police!

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.470
The police are dangerous.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.970
The police are accomplices?

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:53.480
Yes, because Kuro was suddenly attacked by them!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.600
What?

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.810
I was just eating some banana that fell on the floor.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.480
There were a lot of them on the roadside, so I took some.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:02.480
Banana

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:04.820
Grab

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.490
Greengrocer

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.490
Thief~!

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.030
After that, I don't know why, but police started to chase me.

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:12.240
It surprised me.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.500
I'm usually quite confident in my running abilities,

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.330
but I was quite hungry at the time,

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.000
so I was caught, unfortunately.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:20.500
Police

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.500
Punipuni!

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.000
Police

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:24.380
Sea of Tears

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.430
Then I was locked in a dark place.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:25.130
Sea of Tears

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:34.020
Boo hoo

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.720
I'm innocent!

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.310
I'm just a Mototsumitama!

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.020
Let me go!

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:40.690
The wall collapsed as I was pounding on it, and I was finally able to get out.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.780
Isn't that a jailbreak?

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:47.070
That's why the police are very dangerous.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:48.780
We can't contact them.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.450
Punipuni!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.910
Kuro, I understand,

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:58.290
but can you please keep it down?

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.290
But the police are...!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.880
Kuro, save that for later.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.920
What's wrong now?

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.800
Akane-san, there's something I want to discuss with you.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:10.300
W-What is it?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.560
Can I order a Bayshore Jumbo Parfait?

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.600
I-It's okay.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.310
Eat as much as you want.

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.980
Really?!

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.730
Kuro is so lucky!

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:26.070
This is a world where you get caught just for eating bananas found on the roadside!

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:30.660
Keita-san and Akane-san are so kind!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.830
Thanks for the food!

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:40.960
Well, I think the police will understand if you take the time to explain things to them.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:44.210
I don't know who we're dealing with, though.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.710
Well, that's true...

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.470
They won't believe me no matter how I explain it.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:54.300
They'll treat me like a fool if I say that a bunch of people with weird powers are after me.

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:55.760
But...

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.270
I know who we're dealing with.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:01.310
It's my brother.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.810
Your brother?

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.820
To kill my brother.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.570
You said that you're going to kill him.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.410
Yes.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:17.950
Keita-san, the ones who are after you are probably my brother's subordinates.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:22.210
I'm sure my brother is behind the weird happenings that are taking place in this city.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.290
What are you talking about?

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:30.340
Our mission is to defeat Mototsumitama who've forgotten their original purpose and destroy the balance of coexistence.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:34.470
Plus, we're unbeatable right now because Keita-san and I can synchro.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:38.720
Keita-san, fight with me.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.230
What's going on?

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.480
Don't be so selfish.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:51.860
I have nothing to do with you.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:59.290
First, you switched my heart without permission. Then, you tell me to synchro or whatever with you.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.500
What's next?

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:02.660
"Come fight against my brother?"

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.080
Who do you think you are?

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.540
Keita-san...

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:10.550
Didn't I tell you that I didn't want to get involved with someone like you?!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.630
Because of you, my life is in constant danger!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:16.140
Not only can I <i>not</i> go to school anymore, I can't even return home!

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:18.640
But we formed a contract—

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.640
I don't remember forming any sort of contract with you!

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.860
Keita-kun...

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:48.290
The source of the Tera is that Mototsumitama?

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:50.500
Is it all right to leave her be?

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.960
There's no need to be hasty.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.970
What a disappointment.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:02.350
You betrayed my expectations. The expectations of Hiyou-sama, the one who turned you into a Tribal End.

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.640
I-I'm sorry.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:09.690
Isn't there <i>any</i> information that might please me?

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.150
That Mototsumitama...

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.570
is called...

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.570
K-Kuro.

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:21.580
So, it really is Kuro.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.700
Hiyou-sama, please spare my life!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:30.540
Why would I kill you, when you gave me such important information?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.590
On top of that, I'll form a contract with you.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:33.880
Contract?

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:37.550
However, I'd like to perform an experiment first.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:42.220
I want to see if a contract can be formed using an organ other than the heart.

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:47.560
Don't worry. You're a Root.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.850
Someone lucky!

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:52.190
It'll definitely be successful.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:57.340
This is Kuraki.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.260
Enter.

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:00.220
Pardon me.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.770
These are the notes from today's meeting, as well as what we decided on.

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:12.810
I just need Yuki-sama to sign here.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:13.690
Yuki.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:25.830
Kuraki, you still can't find my Sub?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.450
I'm sorry, Yuki-sama.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.960
I'm currently using all the channels available to the group.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:37.460
Reishin, your right-hand man is surprisingly useless.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:41.720
It amounts to the same as searching for gems in the desert.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:45.100
What we're looking for is just a fake glass marble.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:46.180
That's right.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:51.980
Do you know the hardships I had to experience in order to allow you to make use of the Kaionji Group?

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:53.480
I know.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:58.530
Kuraki, you have to produce some results to show your worth as a Master Root.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.820
I understand, Yuki-sama.

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:27.890
Ibuki Keita...

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:33.770
It was really surprising to meet you again in a place like this.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:55.580
Pasta carbonara, shrimp salad, BLT sandwich, diced steak and a Bayshore Jumbo Parfait.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.500
The total is 17,625 yen.

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.420
Um, Keita-san...

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.050
About what happened earlier...

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:10.510
A contract can't be voided unless one of those contracted dies.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:17.270
There are cases in which the Mototsumitama and its contractee behave like enemies.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:24.780
After spending a long time together, the Mototsumitama and its contractee will inevitably share their inner feelings.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.530
As long as they have a strong trust in each other,

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.990
they are able to form a bond that's deeper than anything else.

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:34.250
However, once doubt appears between them...

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:34.870
This is weird.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:35.540
Weird?

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.630
That car has been parked there all this time.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.880
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.130
What are you doing, Keita-kun?!

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.170
It's them!

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.300
We were discovered?

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.440
Wait, why?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:00.900
We were followed!

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.110
They're probably my brother's subordinates.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.230
Hurry!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.510
What do you want?

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:36.520
As ordered, we have found that Mototsumitama, along with two others.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:39.850
Bring only that Mototsumitama girl back alive.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.980
You can kill the others.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.230
Roger.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.240
Keita-san, be careful!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.840
Akane-san!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.850
You're Tribal Ends?

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.470
And if we are?

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:20.230
Are you that whip guy and Tsubouda's comrades?!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:24.650
Hey, hey. Don't compare us to trash like them.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.500
My strength hasn't recovered yet.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.960
You fool...

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:45.460
Take this! Exceed, Tenryuufuudachou!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:48.760
What?!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:53.680
You've been caught by my Exceed, which can catch a dragon soaring in the sky.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:56.640
A Mototsumitama that can't move is no match for us!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.060
Kuro!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.440
Keita-san...

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.110
We caught the Mototsumitama.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.570
So, what should we do with you?

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:20.330
Well, the boss said that we can kill anyone except the Mototsumitama.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:26.580
Akane-san!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:41.520
I was led here by the abnormal flow of Tera,

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:46.730
but I didn't expect to meet these impostors.

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:49.480
Are you the rumored Tribal Ends?

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:53.820
Who gave you those powers?

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.990
There's no way I'll tell you.

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:58.990
I've already predicted who did.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.200
In that case, they're useless.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:04.540
I can't forgive those who get in the way of our mission.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.000
Get lost.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.250
I should be the one saying that.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.630
Take this, Excee—

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.730
We're retreating!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.250
Who are they?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.250
This sensation is amazing...

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.010
It seems that he's able to discern our nature at a glance.

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:57.510
In other words, you are not an ordinary human.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.020
Did you form that contract knowing what you were?

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.520
What I am... I'm obviously a human!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.270
They are...

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:15.650
There's no need to be surprised.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:21.030
The true powers of a Mototsumitama can't be properly wielded if it can't read the flow of Tera.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.950
Are they a Mototsumitama and its contractee?

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:27.330
Yes, and they are very powerful.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:31.040
If I remember correctly, you two came to my bank this afternoon.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.040
You are!

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.550
Thanks for the help!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:39.720
Keita-kun?

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:43.180
You two followed Akane-san?

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.930
Looks like you've got some brains.

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.060
I'm glad you aren't an idiot.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.810
I see. You are really...!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:57.820
However, I didn't expect to meet you like this.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:00.070
Come. I have questions for you.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:04.660
Keita-san!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:10.790
You got Akane-san involved just to find us?

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.790
Keita-kun?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.800
What's the meaning of this?

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.800
Get out of our sight!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.800
I can't agree to that.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:29.850
Contractee, attacking my Mototsumitama is tantamount to declaring a duel with us.

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:34.060
Are you mentally prepared?

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:38.360
Keita-san, this is a duel between us and them.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.690
What?

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:41.320
It can't be stopped.

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.320
Indeed.

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.740
Things aren't going as planned.

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:48.790
This always happens.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:53.670
Our enemies are strong. They are completely different from us.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:54.830
However...

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:57.340
I'm a Mototsumitama.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.510
I shall protect my contractee, Keita-san!

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:03.760
Of course.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:27.490
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:27.490
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:38.920
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:38.920
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:51.220
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:51.220
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:20:51.220 --> 00:21:07.700
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:21:07.700
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.120
What a beautiful view.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:15.500
I wish to hear of the views of those who live at the bottom of the sea.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.500
You can go and ask them.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.290
I've sent Kuraki to Okinawa.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.510
Even though he hasn't found my Sub?

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:27.840
Aren't you going to make me a Master Root?

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:31.470
There's a priority to everything.

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:34.020
Something more precious than me?

